                                "sense_id": "904d1d12-555b-3007-951f-4a83b9745a27",
                                "text": "The wrimouth'd Crittick...\nThat mewes, and puh's and shakes his brainelesse head..."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f7571512-880e-4d4b-b1f4-730e5a091d9b",
                                "sense_id": "904d1d12-555b-3007-951f-4a83b9745a27",
                                "text": "The Doctor... pshaw'd and pooh'd for some time."
